    "All six adaptive policies exceed the uniform allocator in mean final joint score in both collections with either local search method. This is exploratory evidence from five seeds, not a significance claim.",
    "At 8000 choices in the full inventory, H0 has the highest GA mean (17116.4); SP-cal has the highest random-search mean (16557.6). Rankings therefore are not invariant.",
    "The complete H1 hybrid changes from 12846 to 17581 at seed29, but from 17792 to 12601 at seed1. A small change in its five-seed mean hides large changes in individual paths.",
    "Without the three largest maps at 3000 choices, S-cal reaches all 1320 available joint score and all 1097 joint positives with both methods in all five seeds; SP-cal also reaches this ceiling with GA. Expansion is needed for a meaningful 4000-choice comparison."
  ],
